WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:05.177
This is a wholesale fund in Australia.
Its investors hold units on a register.

00:00:05.217 --> 00:00:07.381
How does it become a token on Redbelly?

00:00:07.801 --> 00:00:10.262
Today, registers sit
across separate systems,

00:00:10.302 --> 00:00:13.060
checks are manual, and
settlement takes days.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:18.299
Step one. A legal review confirms the
trust deed allows ownership on chain.

00:00:18.339 --> 00:00:23.396
The manager's existing licence covers it.
There is no separate tokenisation licence.

00:00:23.816 --> 00:00:27.235
Step two. On Tokeniser,
the manager sets the rules:

00:00:27.275 --> 00:00:30.701
who can invest, foreign ownership
limits, lock-up periods.

00:00:30.741 --> 00:00:32.818
They are written into the token itself.

00:00:33.238 --> 00:00:36.686
Step three. Each investor
is verified: identity,

00:00:36.726 --> 00:00:40.073
anti-money laundering screening,
investor classification.

00:00:40.113 --> 00:00:42.828
Until then, no tokens
can reach their wallet.

00:00:43.248 --> 00:00:47.023
Step four. Tokens for their units
are issued on Redbelly Network,

00:00:47.063 --> 00:00:48.647
into verified wallets.

00:00:48.687 --> 00:00:51.177
The register is live from the first token.

00:00:51.597 --> 00:00:55.064
Step five. Every transfer is
checked against those rules first.

00:00:55.104 --> 00:00:57.057
Break a rule, and it is rejected.

00:00:57.097 --> 00:00:59.129
Pass, and it settles in seconds.

00:01:00.349 --> 00:01:02.420
Underneath is Redbelly Network,

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:05.226
Australia's public digital
token infrastructure.

00:01:05.266 --> 00:01:08.829
Every participant's identity
is verified at protocol level,

00:01:08.869 --> 00:01:11.727
and confirmed transactions
cannot be reversed.

00:01:11.767 --> 00:01:14.180
Its consensus is formally verified.

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:17.999
And Australia's central bank
chose Redbelly for Project Acacia.

00:01:18.419 --> 00:01:21.076
Same fund. Same strategy. Same licence.

00:01:21.116 --> 00:01:25.076
Now its units are compliant tokens
on Redbelly, through Tokeniser.
